{
  "title": "Forgetful",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Four tape memories",
        "on one live input.",
        "",
        "Send the input to A,",
        "B, C or D. Each one",
        "then forgets itself:",
        "drifting out of tune",
        "hissing, breaking up",
        "until it is gone.",
        "",
        "Mix the four and you",
        "play against your",
        "own recent past."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Quick Start",
      "lines": [
        "1. Send picks a loop",
        "2. Press REC, play",
        "3. Press REC again",
        "   it loops and ages",
        "4. Press REC again",
        "   to overdub",
        "",
        "Age sets how long it",
        "lives: 3s to 5min.",
        "",
        "Freeze holds a loop",
        "exactly as it is."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Main",
          "lines": [
            "Send  which loop is",
            "      listening",
            "ECHO  all four at",
            "      once",
            "REC   rec/stop/dub",
            "Frz   hold this loop",
            "",
            "A-D   playback speed",
            "",
            "Speeds: 1x, 1/2x,",
            "1/4x, 2x and all",
            "four backwards.",
            "",
            "A change of speed",
            "glides over 5s. A",
            "change of DIRECTION",
            "glides through zero:",
            "it slows, stops, and",
            "runs the other way.",
            "",
            "ECHO is four tanks,",
            "one per loop. The",
            "fill is how much is",
            "left. The character",
            "inside says what it",
            "is doing: R rec, O",
            "dub, F frozen, a",
            "dash for empty.",
            "",
            "The character is a",
            "negative: it flips",
            "as the fill rises",
            "past it.",
            "",
            "On Schwung under",
            "1.2 those four",
            "read as characters",
            "instead.",
            "",
            "Send draws a ring",
            "with a dot running",
            "it at that loop's",
            "speed. The ring is",
            "the lap: wiped on",
            "one, redrawn on the",
            "next. Empty = whole",
            "ring, no dot."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Sound",
          "lines": [
            "Top row: level for",
            "each memory, up to",
            "200%.",
            "",
            "Bottom row: Tone.",
            "Centre is bypass,",
            "left cuts treble,",
            "right cuts bass.",
            "",
            "Tone is reversible.",
            "Turn it back and",
            "what it hid returns."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Loop A-D",
          "lines": [
            "Age   time left, now",
            "START loop start",
            "END   loop end",
            "ECHO  this loop only",
            "",
            "FRQ   fine tuning,",
            "      +/- 12 semis",
            "Warp  wow + flutter",
            "Space reverb send",
            "DUST  surface noise",
            "",
            "START and END give",
            "you any window of",
            "the take. Nothing is",
            "erased: move them",
            "back and it returns.",
            "",
            "Pull END past START",
            "and that section",
            "plays BACKWARDS. It",
            "slows, stops and",
            "turns, it does not",
            "jump.",
            "",
            "Turn Age UP to buy",
            "a faded memory more",
            "time: it comes back",
            "up, still as ruined",
            "as it had become.",
            "Down is just a rate.",
            "",
            "DUST left is VINYL",
            "crackle, right is",
            "hiss. Past halfway",
            "each brings in the",
            "other behind it.",
            "",
            "START and END are",
            "drawn as one",
            "window over the",
            "tape: bright is",
            "what plays.",
            "",
            "Keep turning DUST",
            "left for more:",
            "past 20% a breath",
            "of noise behind",
            "each click, past",
            "40% worn-side",
            "distortion, past",
            "60% grains of the",
            "take thrown back",
            "over it.",
            "",
            "Those three are not",
            "written to tape.",
            "Turn back and they",
            "go."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Glitch",
          "lines": [
            "End of the chain.",
            "Stutters everything",
            "on a grid.",
            "",
            "Mix    dry to wet",
            "Step   the grid",
            "Odds   chance a step",
            "       is glitched",
            "Size   slice length",
            "",
            "Kind   which effect",
            "Reach  how far back",
            "Pitch  slice pitch",
            "Width  stereo spread",
            "",
            "Mix AND Odds must",
            "both be up before",
            "anything happens.",
            "",
            "Kinds: Tumble picks",
            "one per step from",
            "Stutter, Rewind,",
            "Tape, Gate, Crush.",
            "",
            "Reach is the one to",
            "try first: it grabs",
            "from the last two",
            "seconds, so it",
            "quotes the memory",
            "instead of just",
            "repeating it."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "How It Wears",
      "lines": [
        "Warp and DUST are",
        "written back to the",
        "tape every pass, so",
        "they compound. The",
        "knob sets a RATE,",
        "not a sound.",
        "",
        "Turn one a little,",
        "little happens now.",
        "Leave it: the loop",
        "keeps going further",
        "on its own.",
        "",
        "It cannot be undone.",
        "Only a new recording",
        "restores a memory.",
        "",
        "Freeze stops all of",
        "it. Nothing is",
        "written when frozen."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Notes",
      "lines": [
        "Forgetful never",
        "saves its settings.",
        "It starts from",
        "defaults every time,",
        "in every set.",
        "",
        "A take is a",
        "performance, not a",
        "starting point.",
        "",
        "So User Presets and",
        "chain patches cannot",
        "capture it either.",
        "",
        "When a memory dies,",
        "its knobs reset.",
        "",
        "Hold Age, a speed",
        "or FRQ and a",
        "picture of that",
        "setting floats over",
        "the page while you",
        "turn it."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
